{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_title", "source_sha256": "88db4ef8357152f3f2eb2080e50f02de81971436f0e7c4850a4b725d198769e8", "ja": "「君と出会ってから」我那覇響", "zh": "“与你相遇之后”我那霸响", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_synopsis", "source_sha256": "16fa609a7afd1f4270335f4b13bd2409fe889173859dc1a075c92d3965e6c287", "ja": "Destiny公演を前に、\n響とプロデューサーが出会った頃からの\nことを振り返る一幕です。", "zh": "这是在Destiny公演前夕，\n回顾响与制作人从相遇之时起\n一路走来的点点滴滴的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6f9ebab2e13b8e99e1d73d8529efd768bba7b4c85c78c35f7d0f59f034a5e27b", "ja": "（Destiny公演が間近に迫り、アイドル達のレッスン\nもいよいよ大詰めだ。今日は劇場で貴音が……）", "zh": "（Destiny公演迫在眉睫，偶像们的训练也终于进入最后阶段了。今天贵音在剧场……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "175d4826a7ff93aeeda19168174e2a00601aca4dba4321625b3a609719f16a50", "ja": "ハム蔵ー！？　どこ行ったの、ハム蔵ー！！\n自分が悪かったってばー！", "zh": "哈姆藏——！？你跑到哪里去了，哈姆藏——！！\n都说了是我不好嘛——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4c511977de1496289ce8075f7fb8ade227d94e984bc949697ca585d88df12053", "ja": "（あれ、この声は……響だよな？\n今日はオフだったはずじゃ……？）", "zh": "（咦，这个声音是……响吧？今天不是休息吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1003_p", "source_sha256": "65e988498495ef1a7ba7357a2da91b3b87eee86cb398c24e2ddca2e6158ea065", "ja": "おーい、響！　急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "喂——响！怎么突然来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "4399c95f67066a6d36b11f46e7b5d2480d804a19f232ffdc0d7acfc8bc7db1fc", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nねぇ、ハム蔵を見なかった？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n那个，你有没有看到哈姆藏？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1954cb2b2016b7f4d25b2fd7a8c37e22a10a372db2266609d8a522160f344ea8", "ja": "いや、見てないけど。\nどうしたんだ？　外ではぐれたのか？", "zh": "没看见。\n怎么了？是在外面走散了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "99da2e09ae8cadbedd8d00f161188216a19fd74dabc1151ef1c335361c2dbe67", "ja": "はぐれたっていうか、近くまで来たら急に飛び出して、\nそのままどこかに行っちゃったんだ！", "zh": "与其说是走散了，不如说是快到附近时突然冲了出去，然后就跑到什么地方去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "6c41c06f20b8db92233d9b017bcd99184bd6a7ed196c4ddfdb9bf612ad323215", "ja": "きっと怒って家出したんだ……そうなんだ！\nうぎゃー！　自分はどうすればいいんだ～！？", "zh": "它一定是生气离家出走了……肯定是这样！\n呜哇——！我该怎么办才好啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2dbb7c88c6cc383cd1c562aff1b72132ad82b9d7eeb62bb55c90bef95e6e8419", "ja": "いや、まずは落ち着いて。……ハム蔵が怒ってる？\nまたハム蔵のピーナッツを勝手に食べたのか？", "zh": "不，先冷静一下。……哈姆藏在生气？\n你又偷吃了哈姆藏的花生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "79378e5ffb43affeaff3504c77363fb21235e948e8173f8cddce85bb4c873eea", "ja": "ううん、今日は食べてない……。\nおなかも減ってないし。", "zh": "不是，今天没吃……。\n而且肚子也不饿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1010_p", "source_sha256": "15ed3511694076f88c8817487050573279926523477496a82aa31f4ef075a9bb", "ja": "そ、そうか。今日は食べてないのか……。\nじゃあ、ケンカでも？", "zh": "这、这样啊。今天没吃东西吗……  \n那是因为吵架了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "4d4ea529c02935d84339e797b9f7a526e9ed789e1d7dec0d00a8236e90fee3f7", "ja": "ケンカもしてないけど、心当たりはあって……。自分、\n最近いつもより多めに自主レッスンを入れてたんだ。", "zh": "虽然也没吵架，不过我倒是想到了一件事……我最近安排的自主训练比平时多了一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "83e766fa84e2ec21c32bf42696e09086382bf241cd34733ac39048371a52ad42", "ja": "あ、ホントにちょっとだけ！\n全然無理とかはしてないからね！", "zh": "啊，真的只有一点点！\n完全没有勉强自己哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1013_p", "source_sha256": "706705d80721b19a1937890b4f9715b81197d41f1dc559072d2c08b45d436569", "ja": "そうだったのか。それで今日も劇場に……\nどうしてだ？　公演が近いからか？", "zh": "原来是这样。所以你今天也来剧场……\n为什么？是因为公演快到了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "d314c1bf69dbf9de4f8ba8cc0cfec58c973c92f1b506d4dac4e2b4353ebc78bc", "ja": "うん。自分はカンペキだけど、\n今度の公演では、カンペキのカンペキにしたくてさ。", "zh": "嗯。我自己是已经很完美了，\n但下次公演，想做到完美之上的更完美嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "4d76a915d9824833fbc5c0fe367087e5d57c2764a2431d9411a5c9aaea6833c1", "ja": "でもレッスンを増やしたぶん、ハム蔵たちと一緒にいる\n時間がへって……寂しい思いをさせちゃってたんだ。", "zh": "不过，因为增加了训练，和ハム蔵它们待在一起的时间变少了……结果让它们感到寂寞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "6cbb0275b7d9e5886860ceb94ca1d6c063fdceea123f1d9bf65f406b7bc26a2f", "ja": "だから、今日はハム蔵とだけでも一緒にいようと思って\n連れてきたんだけど……なのに、急に……！", "zh": "所以，我想着今天至少也要和哈姆藏待在一起，就把它带来了……可是，没想到突然……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c789a0fa74ba4012c8fcdaf1bb0ec58e4abc1bae5e9aea7d410c1479bb06b5e2", "ja": "うーん……なるほどな。", "zh": "嗯……原来如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "f2802650f66bf27879bb986ff2c540d53232d1b142145ad19efc29d1f41e6bac", "ja": "ハム蔵、そんなに怒ってたのかな？　もう帰ってこない\nなんてこと無いよね？　ね、絶対無いよね！？", "zh": "哈姆藏，真的那么生气吗？不会就这样再也不回来了吧？不会的，对吧？肯定不会的吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1019_p", "source_sha256": "19a853555733e6fc65db603bd27242b45eff0239f39c3069295c35794156a848", "ja": "うん、それはない。", "zh": "嗯，那不可能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "4e4fd4c8f5f86345afabc24d50ba57d302dfcab9b57f31158e4f2b37a7d37af9", "ja": "って、どうして断言できるんだ？\nなんか適当に言ってない！？", "zh": "话说，你怎么能这么肯定？\n你是不是在随口乱说啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1021_p", "source_sha256": "4c1fd12fb007a6e40444339a3a2bea853bc50f37636621300688e62b66f2a0b4", "ja": "適当じゃないよ。ハム蔵と同じく、\nずっと響のそばにいる者として言ってるんだ。", "zh": "我不是在随便说。我是以一个一直陪在响身边的人、和哈姆藏一样的身份这么说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1023_p", "source_sha256": "71d2238e26661278f4ac4412d6ee9b057ebd4d610fc33f3d856104b2dd1a9d0c", "ja": "響を一人にしたら、どれだけ寂しがることか。\n心配すぎて、そんなことできるわけがない。", "zh": "要是把响一个人留下，她得多寂寞啊。实在太让人担心了，怎么可能做得到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "023e2544b9c1ac5f4dcf80b888ba58f30bcafd5f591a523e082acec8647c7bc2", "ja": "そ……っ、そんなの、寂しがるのが当然でしょ？\nハム蔵は自分の、自分たちの大事な家族なんだし。", "zh": "我、我说……那种情况下，当然会寂寞吧？  \n哈姆藏可是我的、是我们重要的家人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1025_p", "source_sha256": "46b70d383344c0eae8321321471417bbd751c9a90886524af921dd84485a828f", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\nだからハム蔵は、どこにも行かないよ。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。\n所以哈姆藏不会去任何地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1026_p", "source_sha256": "f56a6c43e18d9f2e2308e7a87c76c67dc7cbbe9be5c0d64be8aa70b06b0cbb59", "ja": "（一緒に過ごす時間が減って、寂しい思いを\nしていたのは、きっとハム蔵よりも……）", "zh": "（因为一起度过的时间变少而感到寂寞的，肯定不只是哈姆藏……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1027_hamuzou", "source_sha256": "66d2e3dcccc1fbe4dfb30c1cc5672282225e61ad958535f125b9be5524416da4", "ja": "キュー！", "zh": "Action！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "4599d8dd9d01bbce2cf96bd51a1c8fd591b1adb9bc0580f9f7390ecfbfe7b1d2", "ja": "あっ、ハム蔵！？　ハム蔵～！！　よかった～～！！\nもう、心配したんだぞ！　どこ行ってたの～！？", "zh": "啊，哈姆藏！？哈姆藏～！！太好了～～！！\n真是的，人家好担心你啊！你跑去哪里了呀～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "64b288e37738e1d91ceca0efd3303ca7d6bddf8b13a41a2c98f3332264b4e923", "ja": "ええっ！？　劇場についたら自分がすぐレッスンできる\nように、近道で先回りして準備してた！？", "zh": "诶！？为了到了剧场后能马上练习，你还特地抄近路先到这里准备！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1030_p", "source_sha256": "f203e78bc126c206f179b557ad3403039135f0052414c1180010e0d25ea0ce5a", "ja": "なのに来ないから、今度は迎えに来てくれたのか。\n……さすがだな、ハム蔵！", "zh": "可我一直没来，所以这次你是来接我的吗。  \n……真不愧是你啊，哈姆藏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1031_hamuzou", "source_sha256": "66d2e3dcccc1fbe4dfb30c1cc5672282225e61ad958535f125b9be5524416da4", "ja": "キュー！", "zh": "Action！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1032_013hib", "source_sha256": "db96116b472a1b2047723fd118731cce7868e8617d73f73a684071e96ac13d86", "ja": "ううっ、ハム蔵……、君は、君は……！！\nなんていいやつなんだ～～っ！！　ありがとね！！", "zh": "呜呜，火腿藏……你、你这家伙……！！\n怎么会这么好啊～～！！谢谢你哦！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1033_013hib", "source_sha256": "8d4b268288c3c7ba0fde325d95652f17e8649a66af4013ce6a608edf9011249b", "ja": "でも、おかげでますます火が付いたぞっ！\n今度の公演は、もうカンペキのカンペキで決まりさー！", "zh": "不过，多亏了你，反而让我干劲十足了！\n下次公演就以完美中的完美来决定啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1034_hamuzou", "source_sha256": "31281d62686322a9d07c06a891084193b6aa3e0e1a28c90a314295d081745336", "ja": "キュッキュキュー！", "zh": "擦擦擦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1035_p", "source_sha256": "7cf02fd621ad097e4a8e3bb137fd4ed861719386849d1df7e0be08597520ef96", "ja": "おお、すごい自信だ。\n響は家族がそばにいるだけで、力が湧いてくるんだな！", "zh": "哦，真是自信满满啊。\n原来响只要家人在身边，就会充满力量呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1036_013hib", "source_sha256": "4783933eeb754baa7687a8820b8d10f46a2b9ec017c2e9a86394db99150aa6f8", "ja": "そうだね。でも、それだけじゃないぞ。\n自分がカンペキなのも、みんなのおかげだから。", "zh": "是啊。不过，还不止这些。\n我之所以能这么完美，也是多亏了大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1037_013hib", "source_sha256": "d4a5034718d61437f46c68986b5e59a90abd40f69d9cb12255ddaf138442793e", "ja": "島のみんな、家族たち、事務所の仲間、\n劇場のみんな、ファンのみんな……。", "zh": "岛上的大家、家人们、事务所的伙伴们、\n剧场的大家、粉丝们……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1038_013hib", "source_sha256": "d2bad88db03e9313b4dcb9657ecdec0c107e342cf02040e99c75c63f3c9251ef", "ja": "あと……、{$P$}も。", "zh": "还有……{$P$}也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1039_013hib", "source_sha256": "9a1942ec3346554a62bbbd7b9ef1e12bd9cf6a4d3bab11f35353ccf5e795441e", "ja": "みんなが信じてくれるから、自分はどこまでも頑張れる\n……みんなの応援が、そのまま自分の力なんだ！", "zh": "因为大家都相信我，所以我无论到哪里都能努力下去……大家的支持，就是我的力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1040_013hib", "source_sha256": "ee1b46cfd8d683b2dc0746b7de5959da18af0169fef4989b3cd76af3b779352f", "ja": "ねぇ、{$P$}。\nこれからも自分を信じて、ついて来てくれるよね？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。\n今后也会相信我，跟着我走下去，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1041_p", "source_sha256": "0af54b09e1d909a1f536d4e2e0f9aa44cb51362942ce22271aae818cb260001e", "ja": "……出会ったころからずっと信じてるよ。\nだから大丈夫！　響はずっとカンペキだ！", "zh": "……从我们相遇的时候起，我就一直相信着你哦。\n所以没问题的！响一直都很完美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1042_013hib", "source_sha256": "30cfaa7df2f46f71227d99c480e21dd03ae0e378c38bb8b68a2c1ea504085950", "ja": "えへへ……♪\nうんっ、ありがとね！", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪\n嗯，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_013hib_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_013hib_1043_p", "source_sha256": "5914c51e305fc0ce6a7892c1853eb2e626689241edc583d82da5556c5381428b", "ja": "（家族や周囲の人達の絆の強さが、そのまま響の自信に\nなる。この先も絆の力で、輝かせないとな！）", "zh": "（家人和身边的人之间深厚的羁绊，会原原本本地成为响的自信。今后也要用羁绊的力量，让她绽放光芒才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
